40/extras/8380dc55f3b08c87c06c34f3036e1aea.poster.avif?t=1751303251\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084540/extras/8380dc55f3b08c87c06c34f3036e1aea.webm?t=1751303251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084540/extras/8380dc55f3b08c87c06c34f3036e1aea.mp4?t=1751303251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple ways to play</h2>How you spend the hour is entirely up to you. Explore the deepest depths of the estate to collect as many useful items, awakened souls and ancient artifacts as you can before midnight or go directly into the god's territory to challenge it.  Hold your ground or prevent the God's release all together.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084540/extras/2a50013a6125c7032a012041246c75fe.poster.avif?t=1751303251\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084540/extras/2a50013a6125c7032a012041246c75fe.webm?t=1751303251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084540/extras/2a50013a6125c7032a012041246c75fe.mp4?t=1751303251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Discover Awakened Souls and consume them as extra lives or use their essence to upgrade your own body and essence.</strong> <br><br></li><li><strong>Obtain unique weapons, items and spiritual artifacts to aid you as you forge your own path.</strong><br><br></li><li><strong>Carve your own approach to fighting the cult whether it's defensively, offensively or strategically. </strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084540/extras/b6aff9f095f5b2e35e8a1aec84cd6a7d.poster.avif?t=1751303251\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084540/extras/b6aff9f095f5b2e35e8a1aec84cd6a7d.webm?t=1751303251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084540/extras/b6aff9f095f5b2e35e8a1aec84cd6a7d.mp4?t=1751303251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "A frantic, race-against-time survival horror game with Roguelite and Metroidvania elements. Traverse a decrepit, cultist-infested estate and collect awakened souls to conquer an ancient god looking to feast on your essence. Before midnight strikes\u2014can you defeat the god or prevent its return?",
